  "description": "Soldiers from the 36th Engineer Brigade from Fort Hood, Texas load 32,000 Meals-Ready-to-Eat to an America Red Cross distribution warehouse in support of the relief efforts to victims of Hurricane Harvey in Beaumont, Texas Sep. 1. The Department of Defense is conducting Defense Support of Civil Authorities operations to the State of Texas in response to the effects of Hurricane Harvey. DSCA operations are part of the DoD’s response capability to assist civilian responders in saving lives, relieving human suffering and mitigating property damage in response to a catastrophic disaster.",
